OL,3,GNEWSAMedieval priory gatehouse no
OL,4,Alonger at risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FA medieval gatehouse has been removed
OL,7,Ffrom a register of Nottinghamshire
OL,8,Fbuildings at risk, but a church has
OL,9,Fbeen added.
OL,11,FHistoric England compiles the list to
OL,12,Fhighlight heritage sites which are in
OL,13,Fparticular need of investment to
OL,14,Fsafeguard their future.
OL,16,FThe Grade I listed 14th Century Worksop
OL,17,FPriory Gatehouse was originally added
OL,18,Fto the register in 1998, but after
OL,19,Fyears of restoration work it has now
OL,20,Fbeen returned to community use.
