OL,3,GNEWSAMedieval priory gatehouse no
OL,4,Alonger at risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, St Catherine's in Teversal,
OL,7,Fwhich dates back to the 12th Century,
OL,8,Fhas been added as issues with the roof
OL,9,Fmean much of its 17th Century interior
OL,10,Fis threatened by water leaks.
